  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>\t(đường chéo hình vuông).<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (định lí ba đường vuông góc).<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math> là góc phẳng nhị diện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại A, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.",
